                        "review": "It's partly FTL-clone, with classic HoMM1-style tactical battles on hexes, about nightmarish japanese folklore. \nYou unlock characters just like ships in FTL, and navigate the same map structure, but this one has much more emphasis on text-based adventure generator, guiding you around several inevitable story key-points. Also it reminds of Banner Saga, but rogue-like. Very playable stuff already, so cruel too!",
